// The roof pattern (D241, D258, D290): roof cubes, cut to slopes and corners, drawn as a
// roof from their neighbours (`layout::roofs`, `roofing`): the covering their sloped surface
// in its material, so thick and pushed out by its height, its rows on level lines; each
// line its neighbours make (ridge, hip, valley, eave, verge, flashing) and its frame
// (rafters, battens) a module of pieces. Kinds numbered from 2048. A material of it
// (shakes, slate, thatch) is a few lines naming this pattern and its pack, which gives its
// covering and, where its outline is its look, its own pieces.
//
// eaves       how far its covering is carried on past its cubes' open edges, drawn only
// timber      its rafters' timber
// roof        rows: courses one copy of the covering's texture holds up the slope; phase:
//             where a course's lower edge falls on it; thick: the covering's thickness;
//             relief: how far its texture's height pushes each course out; tint; rafter and
//             batten sizes; parts: the module of pieces each line and the frame is, in its
//             material, with its ends' material and tint
// textures    the texture sets every roof shares: rafters' ends, battens' boards, flashing's
//             mortar; a pack adds its Covering, its rafters' Log and its pieces' atlas
// meets       a roof is drawn over what it rests on, which it neither caps nor ends against
(
    pattern: Roof,
    eaves: 0.5,
    timber: (
        profile: Round,
        notch: Flush,
    ),
    roof: (
        rafter: 0.14,
        batten: (0.06, 0.025),
        parts: {
            Ridge: (module: "ridge", material: Piece),
            Hip: (module: "ridge", material: Piece),
            Valley: (module: "valley", material: Piece),
            Eave: (module: "eave", material: Piece, tint: (0.58, 0.54, 0.5)),
            Verge: (module: "verge", material: Piece, tint: (0.58, 0.54, 0.5)),
            Flashing: (module: "flashing", material: Piece, tint: (0.62, 0.6, 0.58)),
            Rafter: (module: "rafter", material: Log, ends: Some(LogEnd)),
            Batten: (module: "batten", material: Board, tint: (0.9, 0.9, 0.9)),
        },
    ),
    textures: {
        LogEnd: (path: "materials/log_end", metres: (1.0, 1.0)),
        Board: (path: "materials/weathered_planks", metres: (2.0, 2.0)),
        Flashing: (path: "materials/white_stucco", metres: (1.0, 1.0)),
    },
    meets: Some((weight: 0, end: None, carries: None)),
)
